h about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary and grammatical structures.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary and grammatical structures.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary and grammatical structures.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Writes simple but clear texts describing or reviewing places to visit in the region, using an appropriate range of vocabulary and grammatical structures.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking About Banking", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "The people you talk to at the bank are called <span class=\"strong\">bank tellers</span>. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "They can help you with many things like: <li>opening an account <li>depositing money into your bank account <li>taking money out of your account<li>cashing checks<li>applying for a credit card</li>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you are at the bank, the bank teller can make <span class=\"italic\">offers</span>. You can <span class=\"italic\">accept</span> or <span class=\"italic\">reject </span> these offers. It is important to be polite by saying<span class=\"italic\"> thanks </span>and saying <span class=\"italic\">no</span> politely.<br/> At the bank, it is common for you to make requests. You can use <span class=\"italic\">modals</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Infinitives</span> to make requests.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bank Teller</span>: How may I help you? <br><span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: I would like to open an account.<br>   <span class=\"strong\">Bank Teller</span>: Would you like to apply for a credit card also?   <br><span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: No, thanks.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Possessive Adjectives and Pronouns", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Possessive pronouns can take the place of nouns. You use possessive pronouns to talk about things that belong to someone. <br> You use possessive adjectives to describe nouns. They come before the noun.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Possessive  Adjectives\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Possessive Pronouns\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">my</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">mine</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">your</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">yours</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">his</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">his</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" She\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">her</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">hers</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">our</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">ours</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" They\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">their</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">theirs</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "convenient", "type": "name"}, {"content": "useful to you because it saves time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It is convenient for travel, right?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le05ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are the words to review.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to upgrade", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to give someone a better seat on a plane  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Would you like to upgrade to first class?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le05ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "checking account", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a bank account that lets you take money out of at any time, and write checks to pay for things ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I would like to deposit it into my checking account.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le05ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to deposit", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to put money in a bank", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I would like to deposit money into my account. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le05ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to withdraw ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to remove money from the bank", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can withdraw money during the day.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le05ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to transfer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to move money from one account into another", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'd like to transfer $100 into my savings account.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le05ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "funds", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an amount of available money", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can add more when you run low on funds.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le05ob11aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "fee", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an amount paid for a service ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The credit card has a yearly fee.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le05ob11aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "promotion", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an activity to help sell a product", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  We have a promotion going on right now.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le05ob11aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn3le05ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Visit the website of the largest bank in your city. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Research their checking or savings accounts.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Visit another bank's website.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 3 sentences about the information you find.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your information with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write about banking and money.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I express possession.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write complete statements about banking information.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about banking with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}